Netflix Content Analysis Dashboard
Project Overview

This project analyzes Netflix titles to understand the platform's content library, including movies, TV shows, release trends, ratings, countries, and content categories.

The project uses Python for data cleaning and exploratory analysis, followed by an interactive dashboard created in Microsoft Power BI.

Objectives
Analyze the distribution of Movies and TV Shows
Identify content trends by release year
Analyze the most common content ratings
Identify the countries with the highest number of titles
Analyze popular content categories
Understand the overall composition of Netflix's content library
Tools & Technologies
Python
Pandas
Google Colab
Microsoft Power BI
Excel
