Key Insights
Movies make up the majority of Netflix's content library.
Netflix's content additions increased significantly during the late 2010s.
The United States has the largest number of titles in the dataset.
International Movies and Dramas are among the most common content categories.
The average movie duration is approximately 99.58 minutes, with a median duration of 98 minutes.

